  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Johana 21",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya higa, Jesu watsembukira tsona anafundzie kanda-kanda ya Ziya ra Galilaya (piya roihwa “Ziya ra Tiberiya.”) Na hivi ndivyo vyokala: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni Petero, Tomasi ambaye piya kala aihwa “Patsa”, Nathanieli chivyarira wa Kana jimbo ra Galilaya, ana a Zebedayo, na anafundzi anjina airi kala a phamwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 5:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni Petero waambira ayae, “Naphiya vyangu nkavuwe.” Nao achimuamba, “Sisi piya hundaphiya.” Phahi apanda dau achendavuwa usiku kucha, ela taayaphaha chitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati dzuwa kala rinaahula ingu, Jesu waima kanda-kanda ya ziya, ela hara anafundzi taayamtambukira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waauza achiamba, “Enehu, tamphahire ngʼonda?” Nao achiamba, “Tahuphahire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 5:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiaambira, “Tsuphani chimia uphande wa kulume wa dau, namwi mundaaphaha ngʼonda.” Phahi ahenda hivyo, na ariphotsupha chimia, agbwira ngʼonda anji hata asiweze kuchivweha na kuchiinjiza dauni, kpwa sababu ya unji wa ngʼonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanafundzi yemendzwa sana ni Jesu wamuamba Petero, “Hiyu ni Bwana Jesu!” Simoni Petero ariphosikira kala ni Jesu, wavyala nguwoze, (mana kala akazivula) na achidzitabwisa madzini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hara anafundzi anjina akpwedza kanda-kanda ya ziya na dau, kuno anavweha chira chimia chokala chikaodzala ngʼonda, mana kala taakure na kanda-kanda ya ziya, kama nyago gana mwenga bahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphofika kanda-kanda ya ziya, aona moho wa makala na ngʼonda anawadwa. Piya kala phana mkpwahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Jesu achiaambira, “Reheni ngʼonda anjina mchioagbwira vi sambi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Simoni Petero, yekala achere madzini, wavweha chira chimia hadi kanda-kanda ya ziya. Nacho kala chikaodzala ngʼonda akulu-akulu gana mwenga na mirongo mitsano na tahu. Hata dzagbwe chimia kala china ngʼonda anji, ela tachiyadoka bii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Jesu achiaambira, “Ndzoni hufunguleni.” Phahi hara anafundzi osi kala anamanya hakika kukala ni iye, na kpwa hivyo aogopha kumuuza, “We u ani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jesu wahala hura mkpwahe, achiapha anafundzie achirya. Chisha achihala ngʼonda na achihenda dza vivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hino yakala kano ya hahu Jesu kutsembukira anafundzie bada ya kufufulwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kufungula, Jesu wamuamba Simoni Petero, “Simoni, mwana wa Johana, dze unanimendza zaidi kuriko hinya ayao animendzavyo?” Petero achiamba, “Ehe Bwana, hata we mwenye unamanya kala nakumendza.” Achimuambira, “Haya, risa ana ngʼondzi angu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuuza kano ya phiri, achiamba, “Simoni, mwana wa Johana, unanimendza?” Petero achiamba, “Ehe Bwana, unamanya kukala nakumendza.” Achimuamba, “Rinda mangʼondzi gangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuuza tsona kano ya hahu, “Simoni, mwana wa Johana, unanimendza?” Petero wasikira utsungu kpwa kuuzwa kano tahu, “Unanimendza?” Naye achiamba, “Bwana, unamanya chila chitu, mana hata we mwenye unamanya kala nakumendza.” Jesu achimuamba, “Risa mangʼondzi gangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuambira kpweli, uriphokala barobaro, kala ukadzifunga nguwo na ukaphiya ulondako. Ela wakati ndiphokala mtumia, undagolosa mikono na mutu wanjina akufunge na akuphirike usikolonda kuphiya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Jesu wagomba higa kuonyesa ni chifo cha viphi ndichomphaha Petero ili amuphe nguma Mlungu.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achimuamba Petero, “Nilunga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.13.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 13:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero ariphokala anamlunga-lunga, wagaluka, achilola nyuma, na achimuona yuya mwanafundzi yemendzwa sana ni Jesu. (Mwanafundzi hiye ndiye ariyekala lavuni pha Jesu wakati wa chakurya cha dziloni na ndiye kala akamuuza Jesu, “Bwana ni yuphi ndiyekusalata?”) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero ariphomuona yuya amendzwaye, chisha wamuuza Jesu, “Dze yuno, andafwadze?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiamba, “Rinakuhusuni hata nchitaka akale moyo hadi ndiphouya? Phana rako rani, we nilunga tu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi habari hizi zaenea kpwa afuasi osi kala hiyu mwanafundzi kandafwa. Ela Jesu kayagomba hivyo, ela kala akaamba, “Rinakuhusuni hata nchitaka akale moyo hadi ndiphouya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
